WEBVTT

00:03:30.915 --> 00:03:35.711
So you may ask, "Well, how do I access
or unlock this dance magic?"

00:03:36.212 --> 00:03:40.132
Well, once you have the perspective
that life is dance,

00:03:40.174 --> 00:03:41.342
yeah?

00:03:41.676 --> 00:03:44.929
You'll begin to see dance
everywhere around you, all day long,

00:03:44.971 --> 00:03:46.097
like I do.

00:03:46.889 --> 00:03:48.391
Like now.

00:03:48.432 --> 00:03:50.601
Witness how you're sitting in front of me.

00:03:51.143 --> 00:03:52.270
Your posture.

00:03:52.979 --> 00:03:54.897
Are both feet grounded?

00:03:54.897 --> 00:03:57.191
Is one leg crossed over the other?

00:03:57.817 --> 00:03:59.402
Where are your hands placed?